Follow AGENTS.md for architecture, stack, validation, and review requirements.

Start with src/ and client/src/; read docs/openapi.yaml for API contract changes.
Use src/types/reservation.ts as the shared frontend/backend wire contract.
Keep reservation state and API orchestration in client/src/hooks/.
Express 5 forwards async controller failures to src/middleware/errorHandler.ts.
Inspect targeted files first. Read configuration or documentation only as needed.
Do not load dependencies, compiled output, coverage, lockfiles, historical logs,
or generated source maps as agent context; see .cursorignore.
